From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:46:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wallet(v2): add bounded native PSBT interchange codec

Reuse BIP174 magic, maps and proprietary framing with explicit native version 0x4c560001. Preserve canonical native templates, complete Coin-v2 metadata, proof and slot fields without routing v7 through legacy unsigned transactions. Reject duplicates, noncanonical encodings, critical extensions, conflicts, and resource overflows.

Canonical schema: lotus-v2 specification d8a3b859. Fresh native-Chronik/wallet configure and normal 183-action test target build pass; focused C++ cases and all 35 independent schema vectors pass. No native signing or hardware-wallet compatibility is claimed by this codec commit.
